            "snippet": "v@up = normalize(v@P);\nv@N = {0,1,0};\nv@up += 0.1*curlnoise(100.0 * v@P);\n\nfloat progress = chf(\"progress\");\nfloat openAngle = chf(\"openAngle\");\n\n\nprogress = max(progress - f@delay,0);\nf@leafProgress = clamp(progress,0,1);\n\n\nmatrix m = ident();\nrotate(m, -openAngle *f@finalAngle, cross(v@N, v@up));\nv@N = m* v@N;\n\nf@id = @ptnum;\n"
