            "snippet": "float mask = chramp(\"rotateByCurveu\", f@curveu);\nf@rotateAmount = max(mask* chramp(\"rotateByProgress\",f@leafProgress)*chf(\"amount\"), f@rotateMax);\nf@rotateAmount += 0.005 * sin(0.2*@Frame + f@id);\nf@scaleAmount = fit(f@leafProgress, 0, 1, 1, 0.8);"
